  "sop3_b": "Every Friday, 20 minutes. Only wilting, rotten and stuck tasks and tasks waiting for a director are discussed. Each task leaves with a new date and its reason, a new owner, or is cancelled. Fresh tasks are not discussed. The aim is to see what is stuck and who needs help.",
